WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
My family has also been buying meat these days.

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,920
The spirit master has given out so much and I can’t finish it. Please take it back.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,840
If you can't finish it, I can finish it.

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:07,600
There are only two people in the family

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,240
I still have to figure out how to eat this much meat.

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:14,710
If you don't eat hard, you'll be in danger of damaging Sister-in-law Kang.

7
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,670
Didn't your husband work with Professor Wang before?

8
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,830
They all join the rest

9
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,230
Why didn't you go in? Why don't you?

10
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:32,170
It seems like it's really him

11
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:33,370
How did it become like this?

12
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:34,890
The days seem quite unsympathetic

13
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,570
We were leaving now

14
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:38,450
It was he who dragged Brother Kang to practice with us

15
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:40,450
He still laughs at the fact that we will have to live a hard life in the future.

16
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,550
Be smart and be prepared for smart things

17
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:44,420
He already regretted it

18
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,100
My son and Brother Kang have always been with you
